#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:5
msgid "The RELIC biosphere domain (`relic.scientific.biosphere`) represents terrestrial vegetation carbon assimilation, stomatal conductance, autotrophic respiration, organ carbon allocation, structural biomass turnover, leaf phenology, abiotic stress modifiers, and biogenic volatile organic compound (BVOC) synthesis and emission (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapters 20--22). Living vegetation is an open, sunlit, metabolically driven subsystem; accordingly, all 23 concrete biosphere Functors inherit `BiologicalProcessFunctor` and carry `Level 1` (read-only constitutive/observation map) or `Level 2` (open port/stoichiometric balance) `IPHSEquivalenceCertificate` declarations. No closed-system `Level 4` or `Level 5` thermodynamic equilibrium claim is made for living canopy kinetics."
msgstr "RELIC 生物圈领域（`relic.scientific.biosphere`）刻画陆地植被碳同化、气孔导度、自养呼吸、器官碳分配、结构生物量周转、叶片物候、非生物胁迫修正因子以及生物源挥发性有机化合物（Biogenic Volatile Organic Compounds, BVOCs）的合成与排放（《生态学分析方法》，第 20--22 章）。活体植被属于受光照驱动的开放代谢子系统；相应地，全部 23 个具体生物圈算子均继承 `BiologicalProcessFunctor`，并携带 `Level 1`（只读本构或观测映射）或 `Level 2`（开放端口或化学计量平衡）的互连端口哈密顿系统（Interconnected Port-Hamiltonian System, IPHS）等价证书 `IPHSEquivalenceCertificate` 声明。活体冠层动力学不作封闭系统的 `Level 4` 或 `Level 5` 热力学平衡声明。"

