#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:42
msgid "`relic.scientific.biosphere.phenology.base.PhenologyBase` is an abstract base class shared by the concrete phenology implementations and carries no separate certificate. General notation follows [Mathematical Foundations](foundations.md), structural levels follow [DEC, IPHS, and GENERIC](dec_iphs_generic.md), and integrator contracts follow [Numerical Methods](numerics.md)."
msgstr "`relic.scientific.biosphere.phenology.base.PhenologyBase` 是各具体物候实现共享的抽象基类，不单独携带证书。通用符号约定遵循[数学基础](foundations.md)，离散外微分（Discrete Exterior Calculus, DEC）与结构等级定义遵循 [DEC、IPHS 与 GENERIC](dec_iphs_generic.md)，积分器契约遵循[数值方法](numerics.md)。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:48
msgid "Photosynthesis and stomatal conductance"
msgstr "光合作用与气孔导度"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:50
msgid "Farquhar-von Caemmerer-Berry biochemical assimilation"
msgstr "Farquhar-von Caemmerer-Berry 生化同化"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:52
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.biosphere.photosynthesis.farquhar.FarquharPhotosynthesis` (`Level 2`) implements the $\\mathrm{C_3}$ biochemical model of Farquhar, von Caemmerer, and Berry (1980) with peaked Arrhenius temperature scaling of $V_{c\\max}$, $J_{\\max}$, triose-phosphate utilization $T_p$, Michaelis constants $K_c, K_o$, and $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ compensation point $\\Gamma^\\ast$ (Bernacchi et al., 2001; Medlyn et al., 2002; *Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 20). At intercellular $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ partial pressure or mole fraction $C_i$ and oxygen level $O_i$, the Rubisco-limited ($W_c$), RuBP-regeneration-limited ($W_j$), and TPU-limited ($W_p$) gross carboxylation rates are"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.biosphere.photosynthesis.farquhar.FarquharPhotosynthesis`（`Level 2`）实现了 Farquhar, von Caemmerer, and Berry (1980) 的 $\\mathrm{C_3}$ 生化光合模型，对 $V_{c\\max}$、$J_{\\max}$、丙糖磷酸利用速率 $T_p$、米氏常数 $K_c, K_o$ 及 $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ 补偿点 $\\Gamma^\\ast$ 采用带最适温峰值的 Arrhenius 温度标度（Bernacchi et al., 2001；Medlyn et al., 2002；《生态学分析方法》，第 20 章）。在胞间 $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ 分压或摩尔分数 $C_i$ 与氧气浓度 $O_i$ 下，Rubisco 羧化受限（$W_c$）、RuBP 再生受限（$W_j$）与丙糖磷酸利用（TPU）受限（$W_p$）的总羧化速率分别为"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:62
msgid ""
"\n"
"W_c = V_{c\\max}(T_l)\\,\\frac{C_i}{C_i + K_c(T_l)\\left(1 + O_i / K_o(T_l)\\right)},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"W_j = \\frac{J(I_{\\mathrm{APAR}}, T_l)}{4}\\,\\frac{C_i}{C_i + 2\\Gamma^\\ast(T_l)},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"W_p = 3\\,T_p(T_l)\\,\\frac{C_i}{C_i - \\Gamma^\\ast(T_l)},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"W_c = V_{c\\max}(T_l)\\,\\frac{C_i}{C_i + K_c(T_l)\\left(1 + O_i / K_o(T_l)\\right)},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"W_j = \\frac{J(I_{\\mathrm{APAR}}, T_l)}{4}\\,\\frac{C_i}{C_i + 2\\Gamma^\\ast(T_l)},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"W_p = 3\\,T_p(T_l)\\,\\frac{C_i}{C_i - \\Gamma^\\ast(T_l)},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:70
msgid "where electron transport $J$ solves the non-rectangular hyperbola"
msgstr "其中电子传递速率 $J$ 由非直角双曲线方程"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:72
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\theta_J J^2 - \\left(\\alpha_J I_{\\mathrm{APAR}} + J_{\\max}(T_l)\\right)J + \\alpha_J I_{\\mathrm{APAR}} J_{\\max}(T_l) = 0\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\theta_J J^2 - \\left(\\alpha_J I_{\\mathrm{APAR}} + J_{\\max}(T_l)\\right)J + \\alpha_J I_{\\mathrm{APAR}} J_{\\max}(T_l) = 0\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:76
#, python-brace-format
msgid "on its smaller positive root. Gross and net leaf or canopy assimilation [$\\mu$mol $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] satisfy"
msgstr "取较小正根求得。叶片或冠层总同化速率与净同化速率 [$\\mu$mol $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] 满足"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:79
msgid ""
"\n"
"A_{\\mathrm{gross}} = \\left(1 - \\frac{\\Gamma^\\ast(T_l)}{C_i}\\right)\\min_{\\mathrm{smooth}}(W_c, W_j, W_p),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"A_{\\mathrm{net}} = \\beta_{\\mathrm{stress}}\\,A_{\\mathrm{gross}} - R_d(T_l),\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"A_{\\mathrm{gross}} = \\left(1 - \\frac{\\Gamma^\\ast(T_l)}{C_i}\\right)\\min_{\\mathrm{smooth}}(W_c, W_j, W_p),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"A_{\\mathrm{net}} = \\beta_{\\mathrm{stress}}\\,A_{\\mathrm{gross}} - R_d(T_l),\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:85
msgid "where $R_d(T_l)$ is mitochondrial day respiration and $\\min_{\\mathrm{smooth}}$ denotes quadratic co-limitation (Collatz et al., 1991) or exact pointwise minimum according to configuration."
msgstr "其中 $R_d(T_l)$ 为线粒体日间呼吸，$\\min_{\\mathrm{smooth}}$ 根据配置取二次协同限制平滑极小值（Collatz et al., 1991）或逐点精确极小值。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:89
msgid "Optimal stomatal conductance (Medlyn closure)"
msgstr "最优气孔导度（Medlyn 闭合）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:91
msgid "`relic.scientific.biosphere.photosynthesis.stomatal.MedlynStomatalConductance` (`Level 1`) evaluates the optimal water-use-efficiency stomatal conductance law of Medlyn et al. (2011) as a conditional leaf-support observation under the explicit boundary assumption `surface_conditions = \"leaf_surface_equals_canopy_air\"`. Canopy-ground net assimilation is normalized onto leaf area using `leaf_area_index` ($A_{\\mathrm{leaf}}$), leaf-surface $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ is $C_s$ [$\\mu$mol mol$^{-1}$], and vapor-pressure deficit is bounded away from zero by $D_{\\mathrm{eff}} = \\max(D_s, D_{\\min})$ [kPa]. Conductance to water vapor $g_s$ [mol m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] is"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.biosphere.photosynthesis.stomatal.MedlynStomatalConductance`（`Level 1`）在显式边界假设 `surface_conditions = \"leaf_surface_equals_canopy_air\"` 下，将 Medlyn et al. (2011) 最优水分利用效率气孔导度定律作为条件叶支撑域观测量求值。冠层地表净同化速率通过 `leaf_area_index` 归一化至叶面积基准（$A_{\\mathrm{leaf}}$），叶表 $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ 摩尔分数为 $C_s$ [$\\mu$mol mol$^{-1}$]，饱和水汽压差通过 $D_{\\mathrm{eff}} = \\max(D_s, D_{\\min})$ [kPa] 施加严格正下界。对水汽的气孔导度 $g_s$ [mol m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] 为"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:101
msgid ""
"\n"
"g_s =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"g_0, & \\mathrm{PPFD} \\le \\mathrm{PPFD}_{\\mathrm{dark}} \\;\\text{ or }\\; A_{\\mathrm{leaf}} \\le 0,\\\\\n"
"g_0 + 1.6\\left(1 + \\dfrac{g_1}{\\sqrt{D_{\\mathrm{eff}}}}\\right)\\dfrac{A_{\\mathrm{leaf}}}{C_s}, & \\mathrm{PPFD} > \\mathrm{PPFD}_{\\mathrm{dark}} \\;\\text{ and }\\; A_{\\mathrm{leaf}} > 0,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"g_s =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"g_0, & \\mathrm{PPFD} \\le \\mathrm{PPFD}_{\\mathrm{dark}} \\;\\text{ or }\\; A_{\\mathrm{leaf}} \\le 0,\\\\\n"
"g_0 + 1.6\\left(1 + \\dfrac{g_1}{\\sqrt{D_{\\mathrm{eff}}}}\\right)\\dfrac{A_{\\mathrm{leaf}}}{C_s}, & \\mathrm{PPFD} > \\mathrm{PPFD}_{\\mathrm{dark}} \\;\\text{ and }\\; A_{\\mathrm{leaf}} > 0,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:109
msgid "where $1.6$ is the molecular diffusivity ratio $D_{\\mathrm{H_2O}}/D_{\\mathrm{CO_2}}$, $g_0 \\ge 0$ is residual cuticular/minimum conductance, and $g_1$ [kPa$^{1/2}$] is the marginal water-cost slope parameter. `MedlynStomatalConductance` emits `stomatal_conductance` via `REPLACE` without solving an implicit leaf energy balance or mutating carbon pools."
msgstr "其中 $1.6$ 为分子扩散系数比 $D_{\\mathrm{H_2O}}/D_{\\mathrm{CO_2}}$，$g_0 \\ge 0$ 为残余角质层或最小导度，$g_1$ [kPa$^{1/2}$] 为边际水分代价斜率参数。`MedlynStomatalConductance` 通过 `REPLACE` 输出 `stomatal_conductance`，不求解隐式叶片能量平衡，也不修改碳库状态。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:115
msgid "Light-use-efficiency canopy surrogate"
msgstr "光能利用效率冠层代理模型"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:117
msgid "`relic.scientific.biosphere.surrogates.simple_photosynthesis.SimpleCanopyPhotosynthesis` (`Level 2`) provides a diagnostic Monteith (1972) light-use-efficiency closure,"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.biosphere.surrogates.simple_photosynthesis.SimpleCanopyPhotosynthesis`（`Level 2`）提供 Monteith (1972) 光能利用效率诊断闭合式："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:120
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathrm{GPP} = \\varepsilon_{\\max}\\,\\mathrm{APAR}\\,f_T(T_a)\\,f_{\\mathrm{VPD}}(D)\\,\\beta_W,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathrm{GPP} = \\varepsilon_{\\max}\\,\\mathrm{APAR}\\,f_T(T_a)\\,f_{\\mathrm{VPD}}(D)\\,\\beta_W,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:124
msgid "for coarse-scale or calibration workflows where biochemical $C_i$ iteration is not selected. Exactly one photosynthesis owner (`FarquharPhotosynthesis` or `SimpleCanopyPhotosynthesis`) may own `gpp` in a given simulator graph."
msgstr "适用于未选用生化 $C_i$ 迭代的粗尺度模拟或率定流程。在同一仿真图中，仅允许单个光合作用归属算子（`FarquharPhotosynthesis` 或 `SimpleCanopyPhotosynthesis`）持有 `gpp` 的写入权。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:128
msgid "Autotrophic respiration, allocation, and structural growth"
msgstr "自养呼吸、分配与结构生长"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:130
msgid "Maintenance, growth, and total autotrophic respiration"
msgstr "维持呼吸、生长呼吸与总自养呼吸"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:132
msgid "RELIC separates autotrophic respiration into modular `Level 2` owners (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 21; Ryan, 1991; Amthor, 2000):"
msgstr "RELIC 将自养呼吸拆分为模块化的 `Level 2` 归属算子（《生态学分析方法》，第 21 章；Ryan, 1991；Amthor, 2000）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:135
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.biosphere.respiration.maintenance_respiration.MaintenanceRespiration` evaluates organ-summed maintenance cost from live biomass $C_k$ or tissue nitrogen content $N_k$ with $Q_{10}$ or modified-Arrhenius temperature acclimation (Atkin and Tjoelker, 2003):"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.biosphere.respiration.maintenance_respiration.MaintenanceRespiration` 根据活体生物量 $C_k$ 或组织氮含量 $N_k$，结合 $Q_{10}$ 或修正 Arrhenius 温度驯化响应计算各器官求和的维持呼吸消耗（Atkin and Tjoelker, 2003）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:140
msgid "R_m = \\sum_{k \\in \\{\\mathrm{leaf,stem,root}\\}} r_{m,k}\\,M_k\\,f_{T,k}(T_k), \\qquad f_{T,k}(T_k) = Q_{10,k}^{(T_k - T_{\\mathrm{ref}})/10}."
msgstr "R_m = \\sum_{k \\in \\{\\mathrm{leaf,stem,root}\\}} r_{m,k}\\,M_k\\,f_{T,k}(T_k), \\qquad f_{T,k}(T_k) = Q_{10,k}^{(T_k - T_{\\mathrm{ref}})/10}."

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:142
msgid "`relic.scientific.biosphere.respiration.growth_respiration.GrowthRespiration` computes biosynthetic construction cost on positive net assimilatory surplus:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.biosphere.respiration.growth_respiration.GrowthRespiration` 基于净同化盈余的正部计算生物合成建构呼吸消耗："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:145
msgid "R_g = f_{\\mathrm{gr}}\\,\\max(\\mathrm{GPP} - R_m,\\; 0), \\qquad 0 \\le f_{\\mathrm{gr}} < 1."
msgstr "R_g = f_{\\mathrm{gr}}\\,\\max(\\mathrm{GPP} - R_m,\\; 0), \\qquad 0 \\le f_{\\mathrm{gr}} < 1."

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:147
msgid "`relic.scientific.biosphere.respiration.autotrophic_respiration.AutotrophicRespiration` closes the canopy autotrophic carbon flux budget:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.biosphere.respiration.autotrophic_respiration.AutotrophicRespiration` 闭合冠层自养碳通量收支："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:150
msgid "R_a = R_m + R_g, \\qquad \\mathrm{NPP} = \\mathrm{GPP} - R_a, \\qquad \\mathrm{CUE} = \\frac{\\mathrm{NPP}}{\\max(\\mathrm{GPP}, \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{GPP}})}."
msgstr "R_a = R_m + R_g, \\qquad \\mathrm{NPP} = \\mathrm{GPP} - R_a, \\qquad \\mathrm{CUE} = \\frac{\\mathrm{NPP}}{\\max(\\mathrm{GPP}, \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{GPP}})}."

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:152
msgid "Simplex carbon allocation and organ mass conservation"
msgstr "单纯形碳分配与器官质量守恒"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:154
msgid "`relic.scientific.biosphere.growth.biomass_allocation.BiomassAllocation` (`Level 2`) maps environmental light, water, and nutrient limitation signals to organ allocation fractions $\\mathbf{a} = (a_{\\mathrm{leaf}}, a_{\\mathrm{stem}}, a_{\\mathrm{root}})^{\\mathsf{T}}$ (Friedlingstein et al., 1999) satisfying exact simplex normalization:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.biosphere.growth.biomass_allocation.BiomassAllocation`（`Level 2`）将环境光照、水分与养分限制信号映射为满足精确单纯形归一化的器官分配比例向量 $\\mathbf{a} = (a_{\\mathrm{leaf}}, a_{\\mathrm{stem}}, a_{\\mathrm{root}})^{\\mathsf{T}}$（Friedlingstein et al., 1999）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:159
msgid ""
"\n"
"a_k \\ge 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\sum_{k \\in \\{\\mathrm{leaf,stem,root}\\}} a_k = 1,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{alloc},k} = a_k\\,\\max(\\mathrm{NPP}, 0).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"a_k \\ge 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\sum_{k \\in \\{\\mathrm{leaf,stem,root}\\}} a_k = 1,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{alloc},k} = a_k\\,\\max(\\mathrm{NPP}, 0).\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:167
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.biosphere.growth.structural_growth.StructuralGrowth` (`Level 2`) advances organ carbon pools $C_k$ [g C m$^{-2}$] with senescence turnover rates $\\tau_k^{-1}$:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.biosphere.growth.structural_growth.StructuralGrowth`（`Level 2`）以衰老周转率 $\\tau_k^{-1}$ 推进各器官碳库 $C_k$ [g C m$^{-2}$]："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:171
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}C_k}{\\mathrm{d}t} = F_{\\mathrm{alloc},k} - L_k,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"L_k = \\frac{C_k}{\\tau_k}\\,f_{\\mathrm{sen},k},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}C_k}{\\mathrm{d}t} = F_{\\mathrm{alloc},k} - L_k,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"L_k = \\frac{C_k}{\\tau_k}\\,f_{\\mathrm{sen},k},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:177
msgid "emitting integrated pool increments $\\Delta C_k$ via `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)`, litterfall fluxes $L_k$ (`REPLACE`, routed to pedosphere `LitterfallInterfaceMapper`), and prognostic leaf area index $L_{\\mathrm{AI}} = \\mathrm{SLA}\\cdot C_{\\mathrm{leaf}}$ so the step carbon ledger $\\sum_k \\Delta C_k + \\sum_k L_k\\Delta t - \\sum_k F_{\\mathrm{alloc},k}\\Delta t = 0$ closes identically. `relic.scientific.biosphere.growth.phenology_growth.PhenologyGrowth` (`Level 1`) supplies read-only stage-dependent growth multipliers without mutating carbon stocks."
msgstr "通过 `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` 输出积分后的碳库增量 $\\Delta C_k$，通过 `REPLACE` 输出凋落通量 $L_k$（路由至土壤圈 `LitterfallInterfaceMapper`）以及预报叶面积指数 $L_{\\mathrm{AI}} = \\mathrm{SLA}\\cdot C_{\\mathrm{leaf}}$（其中 SLA 为比叶面积（Specific Leaf Area, SLA）），从而使单步碳收支账本 $\\sum_k \\Delta C_k + \\sum_k L_k\\Delta t - \\sum_k F_{\\mathrm{alloc},k}\\Delta t = 0$ 恒等闭合。`relic.scientific.biosphere.growth.phenology_growth.PhenologyGrowth`（`Level 1`）提供只读的分阶段生长乘子，不修改碳储量。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:186
msgid "Phenology and abiotic stress closures"
msgstr "物候与非生物胁迫闭合"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:188
msgid "Leaf phenology models"
msgstr "叶片物候模型"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:190
msgid "Concrete phenology Functors inherit `relic.scientific.biosphere.phenology.base.PhenologyBase`:"
msgstr "具体物候算子均继承 `relic.scientific.biosphere.phenology.base.PhenologyBase`："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:192
msgid "`StaticPhenology` (`Level 2`): emits prescribed stationary $L_{\\mathrm{AI}}$ and greenness fraction."
msgstr "`StaticPhenology`（`Level 2`）：输出给定的定常 $L_{\\mathrm{AI}}$ 与绿度分数。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:194
msgid "`GDDPhenology` (`Level 2`): accumulates daily thermal forcing $\\Delta \\mathrm{GDD} = \\max(T_a - T_{\\mathrm{base}}, 0)\\,\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}}$ (`ACCUMULATE`, `per_timestep=True`) to drive logistic budburst, full-canopy plateau, and cold/photoperiod senescence."
msgstr "`GDDPhenology`（`Level 2`）：累积逐日热量强迫 $\\Delta \\mathrm{GDD} = \\max(T_a - T_{\\mathrm{base}}, 0)\\,\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}}$（`ACCUMULATE`，`per_timestep=True`），驱动逻辑斯谛萌芽、满冠平台期以及低温/光周期衰老过程。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:198
msgid "`GSIPhenology` (`Level 2`): evaluates the Jolly et al. (2005) Growing Season Index as the product of piecewise-linear minimum-temperature, photoperiod, and vapor-pressure-deficit indicators, $\\mathrm{GSI} = i_{T_{\\min}}\\,i_{\\mathrm{photo}}\\,i_{\\mathrm{VPD}} \\in [0, 1]$."
msgstr "`GSIPhenology`（`Level 2`）：计算 Jolly et al. (2005) 生长季指数，表示为分段线性最低气温、光周期与饱和水汽压差指标的乘积，$\\mathrm{GSI} = i_{T_{\\min}}\\,i_{\\mathrm{photo}}\\,i_{\\mathrm{VPD}} \\in [0, 1]$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:201
msgid "`CropPhenology` (`Level 2`): tracks vernalization- and photoperiod-weighted thermal units across emergence, vegetative, flowering, grain-filling, and maturity stages (`ACCUMULATE` thermal progress, `REPLACE` stage diagnostics)."
msgstr "`CropPhenology`（`Level 2`）：在出苗、营养生长、开花、灌浆与成熟阶段追踪经春化与光周期加权的热积温单元（热发育进度采用 `ACCUMULATE`，阶段诊断量采用 `REPLACE`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:204
msgid "`PhenologyFunctor` (`Level 1`): projects active phenological stage indices and canopy-activity scalars without owning separate carbon storage."
msgstr "`PhenologyFunctor`（`Level 1`）：投影当前物候阶段索引与冠层活性标量，不独立持有碳库状态。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:207
msgid "Water, nutrient, thermal, and ozone stress Functors"
msgstr "水分、养分、温度与臭氧胁迫算子"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:209
msgid "`WaterStress`, `NutrientStress`, and `ThermalStress` (`Level 1`) are pure constitutive observers mapping soil water content or potential, foliar N and P ratios, and leaf temperature extremes to bounded dimensionless scalars $\\beta_W, \\beta_N, \\beta_T \\in [0, 1]$ (`REPLACE`)."
msgstr "`WaterStress`、`NutrientStress` 与 `ThermalStress`（`Level 1`）均为纯本构观测算子，将土壤含水量或水势、叶片氮磷比以及叶温极值映射为有界无量纲标量 $\\beta_W, \\beta_N, \\beta_T \\in [0, 1]$（`REPLACE`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:214
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.biosphere.stress.ozone_stress.OzoneStress` (`Level 2`) integrates phytotoxic ozone dose above flux threshold $y$ ($\\mathrm{POD}_y$, [mmol m$^{-2}$]; Emberson et al., 2000; Sitch et al., 2007):"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.biosphere.stress.ozone_stress.OzoneStress`（`Level 2`）对超出通量阈值 $y$ 的植物毒性臭氧剂量（$\\mathrm{POD}_y$，[mmol m$^{-2}$]；Emberson et al., 2000；Sitch et al., 2007）求时间积分："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:218
msgid ""
"\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{O_3,stom}} = g_{s,\\mathrm{O_3}}\\,[\\mathrm{O}_3]_{\\mathrm{canopy}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\Delta \\mathrm{POD}_y = \\max\\!\\left(F_{\\mathrm{O_3,stom}} - y,\\; 0\\right)\\Delta t,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{O_3,stom}} = g_{s,\\mathrm{O_3}}\\,[\\mathrm{O}_3]_{\\mathrm{canopy}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\Delta \\mathrm{POD}_y = \\max\\!\\left(F_{\\mathrm{O_3,stom}} - y,\\; 0\\right)\\Delta t,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:224
msgid "committing $\\Delta \\mathrm{POD}_y$ via `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` and emitting the resulting photosynthetic damage factor $\\beta_{\\mathrm{O_3}} = \\operatorname{clip}(1 - a_{\\mathrm{O_3}}\\,\\mathrm{POD}_y,\\; \\beta_{\\mathrm{O_3,min}},\\; 1)$ via `REPLACE`."
msgstr "通过 `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` 提交 $\\Delta \\mathrm{POD}_y$，并通过 `REPLACE` 输出由此产生的光合损伤因子 $\\beta_{\\mathrm{O_3}} = \\operatorname{clip}(1 - a_{\\mathrm{O_3}}\\,\\mathrm{POD}_y,\\; \\beta_{\\mathrm{O_3,min}},\\; 1)$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:229
msgid "Biogenic volatile organic compound (BVOC) synthesis and emission"
msgstr "生物源挥发性有机化合物（BVOC）合成与排放"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:231
msgid "Canopy empirical MEGAN closure and continuous CO2 inhibition"
msgstr "冠层经验 MEGAN 闭合与连续 CO2 抑制"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:233
msgid "`relic.scientific.biosphere.bvoc.megan_model.MEGANModel` (`Level 2`) evaluates canopy BVOC emission rate $E_s$ for compound class $s$ following Guenther et al. (2006, 2012) (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 22):"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.biosphere.bvoc.megan_model.MEGANModel`（`Level 2`）依据 Guenther et al. (2006, 2012) 计算化合物类别 $s$ 的冠层 BVOC 排放速率 $E_s$（《生态学分析方法》，第 22 章）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:237
msgid ""
"\n"
"E_s = \\varepsilon_s\\,\\gamma_{\\mathrm{CE}}(L_{\\mathrm{AI}})\\,\\gamma_P(\\mathrm{PPFD})\\,\\gamma_T(T_l)\\,\\gamma_{\\mathrm{age}}\\,\\gamma_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta)\\,\\gamma_{\\mathrm{CO_2}}(C_a),\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"E_s = \\varepsilon_s\\,\\gamma_{\\mathrm{CE}}(L_{\\mathrm{AI}})\\,\\gamma_P(\\mathrm{PPFD})\\,\\gamma_T(T_l)\\,\\gamma_{\\mathrm{age}}\\,\\gamma_{\\mathrm{SM}}(\\theta)\\,\\gamma_{\\mathrm{CO_2}}(C_a),\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:241
msgid "where $\\varepsilon_s$ is the standard-condition emission factor and $\\gamma_{\\mathrm{CE}}, \\gamma_P, \\gamma_T, \\gamma_{\\mathrm{age}}, \\gamma_{\\mathrm{SM}}$ are the canopy-environment, light, temperature-optimum, leaf-age, and soil-moisture activity factors. For isoprene $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ inhibition, RELIC evaluates the Wilkinson et al. (2009) / Guenther et al. (2012, Eq. 14) Hill curve continuously from intercellular concentration $C_i = r_{C_i} C_a$ ($r_{C_i} = 0.7$, so $C_i = 280$ ppm at $C_a = 400$ ppm):"
msgstr "其中 $\\varepsilon_s$ 为标准条件排放因子，$\\gamma_{\\mathrm{CE}}, \\gamma_P, \\gamma_T, \\gamma_{\\mathrm{age}}, \\gamma_{\\mathrm{SM}}$ 分别为冠层环境、光照（基于光合光子通量密度（Photosynthetic Photon Flux Density, PPFD））、温度最适、叶龄与土壤水分活性因子。对于异戊二烯的 $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ 抑制效应，RELIC 由胞间浓度 $C_i = r_{C_i} C_a$（$r_{C_i} = 0.7$，即当 $C_a = 400$ ppm 时 $C_i = 280$ ppm）连续计算 Wilkinson et al. (2009) 与 Guenther et al. (2012, Eq. 14) 的 Hill 曲线："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:249
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\gamma_{\\mathrm{CO_2}}(C_a) = \\mathrm{IS}_{\\max} - \\frac{\\mathrm{IS}_{\\max}\\,C_i^h}{C_\\ast^h + C_i^h},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\gamma_{\\mathrm{CO_2}}(C_a) = \\mathrm{IS}_{\\max} - \\frac{\\mathrm{IS}_{\\max}\\,C_i^h}{C_\\ast^h + C_i^h},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:253
msgid "with $\\mathrm{IS}_{\\max} = 1.344$, $C_\\ast = 585$ ppm, and $h = 1.4614$. At ambient $C_a = 400$ ppm, this continuous parameterization evaluates to `1.0024713532535012` in `float64` (`1.0024713277816772` in `float32`); RELIC does not apply an ad-hoc discontinuity clamp forcing $\\gamma_{\\mathrm{CO_2}}(400\\;\\mathrm{ppm}) = 1$."
msgstr "其中 $\\mathrm{IS}_{\\max} = 1.344$，$C_\\ast = 585$ ppm，$h = 1.4614$。在环境浓度 $C_a = 400$ ppm 下，该连续参数化在 `float64` 精度下求值为 `1.0024713532535012`（在 `float32` 精度下为 `1.0024713277816772`）；RELIC 不施加强制 $\\gamma_{\\mathrm{CO_2}}(400\\;\\mathrm{ppm}) = 1$ 的人为不连续截断。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:258
msgid "Mechanistic plastidic isoprene, resin-pool monoterpene, and sesquiterpene synthesis"
msgstr "质体异戊二烯、树脂库单萜与倍半萜机理合成"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:260
msgid "**Plastidic MEP isoprene synthesis (`IsopreneSynthesis`, `Level 2`)**: `relic.scientific.biosphere.bvoc.synthesis.isoprene.IsopreneSynthesis` models chloroplastic dimethylallyl diphosphate (DMADP) supply driven by photosynthetic electron transport $J$ and ATP/NADPH energetic availability (Niinemets et al., 1999; Morfopoulos et al., 2014), coupled with isoprene synthase Arrhenius kinetics. Without a permanent leaf storage organ, emission equals instantaneous enzymatic synthesis (`REPLACE`)."
msgstr "**质体 MEP 异戊二烯合成（`IsopreneSynthesis`，`Level 2`）**：`relic.scientific.biosphere.bvoc.synthesis.isoprene.IsopreneSynthesis` 刻画由光合电子传递速率 $J$ 与 ATP/NADPH 能量供给共同驱动的叶绿体二甲基烯丙基二磷酸（Dimethylallyl Diphosphate, DMADP）底物供应（Niinemets et al., 1999；Morfopoulos et al., 2014），并耦合异戊二烯合酶 Arrhenius 动力学。由于叶片内无永久贮存器官，瞬时酶促合成速率直接等于排放速率（`REPLACE`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:268
msgid "**Dual de-novo and bounded storage-pool monoterpene dynamics (`MonoterpeneSynthesis`, `Level 2`)**: `relic.scientific.biosphere.bvoc.synthesis.monoterpene.MonoterpeneSynthesis` separates light-dependent *de novo* synthesis $S_{\\mathrm{denovo}}$ from a specialized resin-duct or glandular-trichome storage pool $P \\in [0, P_{\\max}]$ (Schurgers et al., 2009; Grote et al., 2013). With storage-directed synthesis $S_{\\mathrm{pool}}$ and temperature-driven volatilization release $E_{\\mathrm{pool}} = k_{\\mathrm{rel}}(T_l)\\,P$, raw storage advancement $P_{\\mathrm{raw}} = P + (S_{\\mathrm{pool}} - E_{\\mathrm{pool}})\\Delta t$ is projected onto $[0, P_{\\max}]$:"
msgstr "**从头合成与有界贮存库双通道单萜动力学（`MonoterpeneSynthesis`，`Level 2`）**：`relic.scientific.biosphere.bvoc.synthesis.monoterpene.MonoterpeneSynthesis` 将光依赖从头合成（*de novo*）通量 $S_{\\mathrm{denovo}}$ 与专化树脂道或腺毛贮存库 $P \\in [0, P_{\\max}]$ 区分建模（Schurgers et al., 2009；Grote et al., 2013）。记入库合成通量为 $S_{\\mathrm{pool}}$、温度驱动的挥发释放通量为 $E_{\\mathrm{pool}} = k_{\\mathrm{rel}}(T_l)\\,P$，未截断的库推进量 $P_{\\mathrm{raw}} = P + (S_{\\mathrm{pool}} - E_{\\mathrm{pool}})\\Delta t$ 投影至 $[0, P_{\\max}]$："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:278
msgid "P_{\\mathrm{next}} = \\operatorname{clip}(P_{\\mathrm{raw}},\\; 0,\\; P_{\\max}), \\qquad r_{\\mathrm{bound}} = \\frac{P_{\\mathrm{raw}} - P_{\\mathrm{next}}}{\\Delta t},"
msgstr "P_{\\mathrm{next}} = \\operatorname{clip}(P_{\\mathrm{raw}},\\; 0,\\; P_{\\max}), \\qquad r_{\\mathrm{bound}} = \\frac{P_{\\mathrm{raw}} - P_{\\mathrm{next}}}{\\Delta t},"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:280
msgid "committing $\\Delta P = P_{\\mathrm{next}} - P$ via `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` and recording any capacity-clamp flux explicitly in `pool_boundary_residual_rate` ($r_{\\mathrm{bound}}$) so the terpene carbon ledger closes identically:"
msgstr "通过 `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` 提交 $\\Delta P = P_{\\mathrm{next}} - P$，并将任何库容上界截断通量显式记录于 `pool_boundary_residual_rate`（$r_{\\mathrm{bound}}$），使萜烯碳账本恒等闭合："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:285
msgid "\\frac{\\Delta P}{\\Delta t} + E_{\\mathrm{pool}} + r_{\\mathrm{bound}} - S_{\\mathrm{pool}} = 0."
msgstr "\\frac{\\Delta P}{\\Delta t} + E_{\\mathrm{pool}} + r_{\\mathrm{bound}} - S_{\\mathrm{pool}} = 0."

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:287
msgid "**Stress-induced sesquiterpene synthesis (`SesquiterpeneStressModel` `Level 1`, `SesquiterpeneSynthesis` `Level 2`)**: `relic.scientific.biosphere.bvoc.synthesis.sesquiterpene.SesquiterpeneStressModel` (`Level 1`) aggregates oxidative, thermal, and biotic/mechanical stress cues into a non-negative induction multiplier $\\gamma_{\\mathrm{stress}}$ (`REPLACE`), which `relic.scientific.biosphere.bvoc.synthesis.sesquiterpene.SesquiterpeneSynthesis` (`Level 2`) combines with $\\beta$-exponential temperature volatility $\\exp(\\beta_{\\mathrm{SQT}}(T_l - T_s))$ and light-modulated *de novo* farnesyl-diphosphate synthesis (Duhl et al., 2008)."
msgstr "**胁迫诱导倍半萜合成（`SesquiterpeneStressModel` `Level 1`，`SesquiterpeneSynthesis` `Level 2`）**：`relic.scientific.biosphere.bvoc.synthesis.sesquiterpene.SesquiterpeneStressModel`（`Level 1`）将氧化、热与生物/机械胁迫信号聚合为非负诱导乘子 $\\gamma_{\\mathrm{stress}}$（`REPLACE`）；`relic.scientific.biosphere.bvoc.synthesis.sesquiterpene.SesquiterpeneSynthesis`（`Level 2`）再将其与 $\\beta$ 指数温度挥发项 $\\exp(\\beta_{\\mathrm{SQT}}(T_l - T_s))$ 及光调控法尼基二磷酸从头合成（*de novo*）相耦合（Duhl et al., 2008）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/biosphere.md:296
msgid "In composed graphs, users select either canopy empirical `MEGANModel` or the mechanistic compound synthesis owners for a given BVOC flux target so surface emissions to atmospheric chemistry and observation operators have a single writer."
msgstr "在组合计算图中，针对任一给定的 BVOC 通量目标，用户应在冠层经验算子 `MEGANModel` 与机理化合物合成归属算子之间择一配置，确保输入大气化学与观测算子的地表排放具有唯一写入者。"

